"code>. Den Ordner legt die Server-Konfiguration fest (<code>APP_BACKUP_DIR</"
"code>, in Docker das Volume <code>/backups</code>)."
msgstr ""
"The scheduler copies the database once a day to <code>%(backup_dir)s</code>. "
"The folder is set by the server configuration (<code>APP_BACKUP_DIR</code>, "
"in Docker the volume <code>/backups</code>)."

